h_reports/RRA5185-1/_jcr_content/par/teaser.crop.160x90.cm.jpeg/1786625644045.jpeg" width="160" /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;p class="desc"&gt;本报告对南加州爱迪生公司的野火恢复补偿计划进行了中期审查，描述了迄今为止的计划活动并确定了可能为未来野火补偿计划设计提供信息的问题。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;span style="font-size: 12px; color: gray;"&gt;（使用&lt;a href="https://fetchrss.com/feedLink?w=6a63231fec7325bd600fce42" target="_blank"&gt;FetchRSS&lt;/a&gt;生成的提要）&lt;/span&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 14 Aug 2026 00:57:19 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.rand.org/pubs/research_reports/RRA5185-1.html</guid></item><item><title>人工智能、中国和美国安全的新风险：与 Matan Chorev 的问答</title><link>https://www.rand.org/pubs/commentary/2026/08/ai-china-and-the-new-risks-to-us-security-qa-with-matan.html</link><description>&lt;img height="90" src="https://www.rand.org/content/rand/pubs/commentary/2026/08/ai-china-and-the-new-risks-to-us-security-qa-with-matan/_jcr_content/par/teaser.crop.160x90.cm.jpeg/1786129175416.jpeg" width="160" /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;p class="desc"&gt;马坦·乔列夫 (Matan Chorev) 是兰德全球和新兴风险部门的副总裁兼总监。在本次问答中，他讨论了美国和世界面临的一些最重要的挑战。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;span style="font-size: 12px; color: gray;"&gt;（使用&lt;a href="https://fetchrss.com/feedLink?w=6a63231fec7325bd600fce42" target="_blank"&gt;FetchRSS&lt;/a&gt;生成的提要）&lt;/span&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 14 Aug 2026 00:57:19 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.rand.org/pubs/commentary/2026/08/ai-china-and-the-new-risks-to-us-security-qa-with-matan.html</guid></item><item><title>重返校园：三大挑战</title><link>https://www.rand.org/pubs/podcasts/policy-minded/2026/back-to-school-three-big-challenges.html</link><description>&lt;img height="90" src="https://www.rand.org/content/rand/pubs/podcasts/policy-minded/2026/back-to-school-three-big-challenges/_jcr_content/par/teaser.crop.160x90.cm.jpeg/1786625252455.jpeg" width="160" /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;p class="desc"&gt;兰德公司的希瑟·施瓦茨讨论了学生和教师重返课堂时值得关注的三种教育趋势：人工智能、手机、缺勤。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;span style="font-size: 12px; color: gray;"&gt;（使用&lt;a href="https://fetchrss.com/feedLink?w=6a63231fec7325bd600fce42" target="_blank"&gt;FetchRSS&lt;/a&gt;生成的提要）&lt;/span&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 14 Aug 2026 00:57:19 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.rand.org/pubs/podcasts/policy-minded/2026/back-to-school-three-big-challenges.html</guid></item></channel></rss>